<title>NEW ZEALAND: ASB cuts NZ floating, fixed lending rates.</title>
<headline>ASB cuts NZ floating, fixed lending rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ASB Bank said on Friday it had cut its floating home lending rate to 10.75 percent from 11.50 percent.</p>
<p>It also cut its 12 month fixed rate to 9.95 percent, with its three to five year rates at 9.25 percent.</p>
<p>The reduced rates are effective immediately for new loans and from November 29 for existing borrowers.</p>
</text>
